    "name": "Bananamania\u2122",
    "steam_appid": 2842540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842540/extras/5dd999f7f2df06a2c758bf2d988c7eb8.avif?t=1725589189\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>&quot;Bananamania&quot; is a charming 8-bit game featuring a lovable monkey protagonist named Chip. Set in a vibrant jungle, the game follows Chip's quest to collect as many bananas as possible while overcoming obstacles and enemies. Players navigate through pixelated landscapes, swinging from vines, and jumping between platforms in this classic side-scrolling adventure. With retro graphics and nostalgic gameplay, Bananamania offers a delightful gaming experience filled with whimsy and banana-filled excitement. Thanks for checking out this awesome new game! This game is currently under development! To learn more about the game and the concept. Check out the trailer!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842540/extras/5dd999f7f2df06a2c758bf2d988c7eb8.avif?t=1725589189\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>&quot;Bananamania&quot; is a charming 8-bit game featuring a lovable monkey protagonist named Chip. Set in a vibrant jungle, the game follows Chip's quest to collect as many bananas as possible while overcoming obstacles and enemies. Players navigate through pixelated landscapes, swinging from vines, and jumping between platforms in this classic side-scrolling adventure. With retro graphics and nostalgic gameplay, Bananamania offers a delightful gaming experience filled with whimsy and banana-filled excitement. Thanks for checking out this awesome new game! This game is currently under development! To learn more about the game and the concept. Check out the trailer!",
    "short_description": "Check out our all-new 8-bit banana-style game! We think you'll like it! Let us know what you think! We are working with dedication to bring this game in full to you guys very soon!",
